<h3>Catechist's Prayer</h3>

<blockquote>
<p>Lord Jesus, who sanctified the waters of the Jordan<br />
and called me to teach the faith,<br />
give me the grace to communicate the gift of Baptism<br />
with clarity and love.<br />
May my students discover<br />
that they are truly children of God,<br />
sealed by your Spirit<br />
and called to newness of life.<br />
Grant me wisdom for difficult questions,<br />
patience with those who doubt,<br />
and joy in seeing them grow in faith.<br />
May I never tire of proclaiming<br />
that water and the Spirit<br />
are the open door to heaven.<br />
Amen.</p>
</blockquote>

</section>

